{"id":"n75409-2-9","stage":4,"title":"조이다 · 缩紧","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75409-2-9-1","ko":"사람들이 앉을 자리가 없네.","zh":"没地方让人坐了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"앉을","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉을","audio":"/audio/cb7f342c95be3075f14f.mp3"}},{"text":"자리가","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리가","audio":"/audio/9fc2a6b98e2660dff494.mp3"}},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"不在","explanation":"없다：不在；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"7","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없네","audio":"/audio/40299a69ec2e93a5e2b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不在","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人、事物、现象等不占据某处或空间。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c575f92963e2071bdd1e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75409-2-9-2","ko":"여기 자리를 좀 조여서 다른 사람들도 앉도록 하자.","zh":"把这里的座位稍微挪一挪，让其他人也能坐下来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"자리를","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리를","audio":"/audio/516d8c7572e851763074.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"조여서","meaning":"缩紧，紧缩，收缩","explanation":"조이다：缩紧，紧缩，收缩；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"조이다","audio":"/audio/9bffed9ebb06430953f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75409","senseId":"2","lemma":"조이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조여서","audio":"/audio/80b09b534fe426724932.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들도","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들도","audio":"/audio/6ed0e626ad3a3ea4ce4b.mp3"}},{"text":"앉도록","meaning":"担任，任，当","explanation":"앉다：担任，任，当；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"4","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉도록","audio":"/audio/67aacf46d6a712e0ceff.mp3"}},{"text":"하자.","meaning":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하자","audio":"/audio/04b9b32cf095cdd41c5b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"9bffed9ebb064309","term":"조이다","zh":"缩紧，紧缩，收缩","audio":"/audio/9bffed9ebb06430953f8.mp3","entryId":"75409","definition":"缩小所占据的空间或位置；或指变成那样。","pronunciation":["조이다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"担任，任，当","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3",